 "id": "gen1-the-second-strength-pays-once-the-mimicked-one-runs-dry",
 "notes": [
  "Gen 1 Ubers: Venusaur, transformed into Onix (Take Down, Earthquake, Mimic, Strength), mimics Strength into its third slot and spends it; then it picks the fourth slot's Strength. The gen1 `runMove` has no `nopp` check and `deductPP` takes the PP off `side.lastSelectedMoveSlot`, so the fourth slot pays and Strength goes out. The engine asked the first slot holding Strength whether any PP was left and stopped the move (`cant nopp`) (R-M11-122; probe125, m9-gen1ubers-s495-002)"
 ],
